#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up an online lab environment to use Qiskit in the cloud. Choose a "
"preconfigured environment or set up your own."
msgstr ""
"Richte eine Online-Lab-Umgebung ein, um Qiskit in der Cloud zu verwenden. "
"Wähle eine vorkonfigurierte Umgebung oder richte deine eigene ein."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments"
msgstr "Online-Lab-Umgebungen"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments {#online-lab-environments}"
msgstr "Online-Lab-Umgebungen {#online-lab-environments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to downloading and installing Qiskit to work on your local "
"machine, there are several options available for those who prefer to work in"
" an online development environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Neben dem Herunterladen und Installieren von Qiskit auf deinem lokalen "
"Rechner gibt es mehrere Optionen für alle, die lieber in einer Online-"
"Entwicklungsumgebung arbeiten möchten.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Several providers offer online Jupyter environments with Qiskit preinstalled"
" for fast and convenient onboarding. These recommended providers include the"
" cloud service provider OVHcloud and the quantum software development cloud "
"platform qBraid.\n"
msgstr ""
"Verschiedene Anbieter bieten Online-Jupyter-Umgebungen mit vorinstalliertem "
"Qiskit für einen schnellen und bequemen Einstieg an. Zu diesen empfohlenen "
"Anbietern gehören der Cloud-Dienstleister OVHcloud und die Quantum-Software-"
"Entwicklungsplattform qBraid.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recommended notebook environments with Qiskit preinstalled {#recommended-"
"notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"
msgstr ""
"Empfohlene Notebook-Umgebungen mit vorinstalliertem Qiskit {#recommended-"
"notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional online Jupyter notebook environments like IBM Watson&reg; Studio,"
" Google Colab, and Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio can be used to "
"work with Qiskit by following the appropriate instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Weitere Online-Jupyter-Notebook-Umgebungen wie IBM Watson&reg; Studio, "
"Google Colab und Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio können für die "
"Arbeit mit Qiskit genutzt werden, indem du die entsprechenden Anweisungen "
"befolgst.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "OVHcloud AI notebooks {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"
msgstr "OVHcloud AI Notebooks {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"OVHcloud Public Cloud and OVHcloud Startup users can use their OVHcloud "
"quantum notebooks to access Qiskit and submit jobs to IBM&reg; QPUs with "
"their IBM Quantum&reg; or IBM Cloud&reg; account. To learn more, visit the "
"[OVHcloud Documentation and tutorials](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-"
"documentation?id=kb_home) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nutzer von OVHcloud Public Cloud und OVHcloud Startup können ihre OVHcloud "
"Quantum Notebooks verwenden, um auf Qiskit zuzugreifen und Jobs an IBM&reg; "
"QPUs mit ihrem IBM Quantum&reg;- oder IBM Cloud&reg;-Konto zu übermitteln. "
"Weitere Informationen findest du auf der Seite [OVHcloud Dokumentation und "
"Tutorials](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-documentation?id=kb_home).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"OVHcloud AI notebooks are not available in some regions, such as the United States. Additionally, user interfaces might look different in different regions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"OVHcloud AI Notebooks sind in einigen Regionen nicht verfügbar, z. B. in den Vereinigten Staaten. Außerdem können Benutzeroberflächen in verschiedenen Regionen unterschiedlich aussehen.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to get started:\n"
msgstr "Befolge diese Schritte, um loszulegen:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Erstelle ein IBM Cloud-Konto](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set up an OVHcloud account](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-"
"create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Richte ein OVHcloud-Konto ein](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-"
"create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an OVH Public Cloud project](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Erstelle ein OVH Public Cloud-"
"Projekt](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in [Launch your first AI "
"Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-"
"definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), selecting "
"**Qiskit** for the framework.\n"
msgstr ""
"Befolge die Schritte unter [Launch your first AI "
"Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-"
"definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), und wähle "
"**Qiskit** als Framework.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"
msgstr "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit users can use qBraid's preconfigured Python environments by following"
" these instructions. For more information, see the [qBraid "
"Docs](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit-Nutzer können die vorkonfigurierten Python-Umgebungen von qBraid "
"verwenden, indem sie diese Anweisungen befolgen. Weitere Informationen "
"findest du in der [qBraid-"
"Dokumentation](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up an qBraid free account](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Erstelle ein kostenloses qBraid-"
"Konto](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Lab environment](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-"
"started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Erstelle eine Lab-Umgebung](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-"
"started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launch qBraid Lab, click the **ENVS** icon on the right, click **+ ADD** at "
"the top of the new sidebar, and search for Qiskit.  Click the version you "
"want to use, then click **Install**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Starte qBraid Lab, klicke auf das **ENVS**-Symbol auf der rechten Seite, "
"klicke auf **+ ADD** oben in der neuen Seitenleiste und suche nach Qiskit. "
"Klicke auf die gewünschte Version und dann auf **Install**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a Jupyter notebook by clicking **Python 3 [Qiskit]** in the Notebook "
"section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Erstelle ein Jupyter Notebook, indem du im Abschnitt Notebook auf **Python 3"
" [Qiskit]** klickst.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can install any additional Python packages (Such as Qiskit v1.2) in a "
"notebook cell by running `%pip install [package_name].` For more "
"information, see the [Pip (magic) "
"commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-"
"commands) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst zusätzliche Python-Pakete (z. B. Qiskit v1.2) in einer Notebook-"
"Zelle installieren, indem du `%pip install [package_name].` ausführst. "
"Weitere Informationen findest du im Thema [Pip (magic) "
"commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-"
"commands).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional notebook environments for Qiskit users {#additional-notebook-"
"environments-for-qiskit-users}"
msgstr ""
"Weitere Notebook-Umgebungen für Qiskit-Nutzer {#additional-notebook-"
"environments-for-qiskit-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For platforms without Qiskit preconfigured, the setup instructions are "
"similar, except that you must install Qiskit manually. You will create an "
"account, start a new project (or notebook or workspace, depending on the "
"platform), and install Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Für Plattformen ohne vorkonfiguriertes Qiskit sind die Einrichtungsschritte "
"ähnlich, allerdings musst du Qiskit manuell installieren. Du erstellst ein "
"Konto, startest ein neues Projekt (oder Notebook oder Arbeitsbereich, je "
"nach Plattform) und installierst Qiskit.\n"

